Notes for running Firebase for Website
How to go back
When you are ready to bring your static site back online, simply delete the "redirects": [...] block from your firebase.json and
 run the "firebase deploy" command again. Your original files (since your public is set to .) will start serving immediately.

 For disabling again and pointing to LI profile - uncomment the redirect block and then run:
 firebase deploy --only hosting
 
